<title>MEXICO: Motorola sees '97 Mexico sales up 60 pct.</title>
<headline>Motorola sees '97 Mexico sales up 60 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc's Mexican arm sees its radiocommunication equipment sales increasing 60 percent in 1997, a company director told reporters on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Our aim is to grow 60 percent compared to last year's sales,&quot; which were close to 80,000 units, said Benito Celorio, director of distribution at Motorola de Mexico.</p>
<p>((--Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau +523 817-0397))</p>
